  "notes": "Weebly site, answered normally; no bot check or captcha was hit. Every photo URL is the full-size _orig file; each was checked with a HEAD request only and none was downloaded or viewed, so nothing was judged by eye. Logo is the full-size original of the header logo (aquascene-logo-bold_orig.png). Hero is the drone photo dji-fly-20240701 from the home page carousel; the Discovery page lead (aquascene-magnetic-island-teq.jpeg) would be the alternative. Gallery leads with the home page carousel and drone photos, then the Gallery page slideshow and Discovery page photos. Circumnavigation Explorer Tour and Northern Islands Adventure have no photos of their own, so their lists are empty; aquascene-five-bays-magnetic-island.jpg (on the Discovery page) suits the circumnavigation. Videos: the three YouTube videos are embedded on the home page with no title or caption and no YouTube channel is linked from the site, so their titles are generic and ownership was not checked; the mp4 is hosted on the site and is on the schools page. LEFT OUT: photos whose file names suggest a tourism body or library (aquascene-magnetic-island-teq.jpeg, 137907-402132-56.jpg, 137933-402127-56_orig.jpg, 149151-2022-tsv-magneticisland-aquascen-1-2.jpg); the Discovery page header graphic (aquascene-discovery-eco-tour-tour-header.png) and award, certification and badge images (tour-guide-gold, boqe2026-stamp-gold, qta and Ecotourism logos); maps (aquascene-map-2 files); the Townsville page screenshot and two meeting-point images (website_orig.jpg, breakwater.jpg) and the ferry timetable; the brochure graphic sunset-brochure_2.jpg; two gallery images that could not be identified (aqs.png, aqspp.jpg); 15_orig.png on the whales page; shop photos; owner portraits on the story page and award photos on the eco and awards pages; section background images, which were not judged. Videos left out: the Snorkelling Sense video on the safety page (credited to Queensland Workplace Health and Safety) and a YouTube video on the schools page (_I1sYRcTowg) whose owner is unclear."
